Benjamin Grayson is a human male, approximately 30 years old in appearance. He has stark white hair and gray, slate-colored eyes. He has a large raiment of the [[Eternal Pulse|Pulse]].

Grayson is the current CEO of [[Org/Amber Call/index|Amber Call]], the foremost premium health insurance provider in [[Geography/Calaria/index|Calaria]]. He is a follower of the [[Eternal Pulse|Pulse]], and secretly is a high level necromancer. He currently resides in [[Nos Mortem]].

In his private study, behind a hinged painting in the master bedroom, is a ritual circle burned into the floor and filled with dried blood. Anzu reads it as a lichdom ritual, built to draw the last life out of a corpse rather than requiring a living victim; within it lies the upper half of [[Mr. Whiskers]]. Grayson's journal, kept in neat handwriting, records his experiments at replacing the motivations of a person while leaving the personality intact. In it he calls the "idiot deer" two-timing for setting up radar dishes after their agreement, and his last entry says two inquisitors were sniffing around Base B and that he will pack up and move.

Grayson is the representative of [[Org/Amber Call/index|Amber Call]] on the Calarian council, one of the ten Orgs that sit on it.
